# Electron build artifacts (externalized, never committed)
# These are what broke Lovable's "connect to GitHub" flow: a packaged build
# leaves ~111 MB installers in electron/, and GitHub rejects any file over
# 100 MB. Keep binaries out of the repo; ship them as release assets.
electron/app/
electron/_pkg/
electron/out/
electron/dist/
*.exe
*.nupkg
*.pdb

# Environment files. Only .env.example is committed; keep real values local.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

